KIMCHI DAY HERE IN CALIFORNIA.

00:24:13.652 --> 00:24:16.721
NOW AS MANY OF YOU ARE AWARE,

00:24:16.788 --> 00:24:17.923
KIMCHI IS A CLASSIC KOREAN DISH

00:24:17.989 --> 00:24:18.990
MADE OF FERMENTED VEGETABLES

00:24:19.057 --> 00:24:21.593
TRADITIONALLY PREPARED THROUGH A

00:24:21.660 --> 00:24:22.594
PROCESS CALLED GIMJANG, WHERE

00:24:22.661 --> 00:24:24.663
COMMUNITY MEMBERS COME TOGETHER

00:24:24.729 --> 00:24:25.764
TO PREPARE ENOUGH KIMCHI TO LAST

00:24:25.831 --> 00:24:27.933
THROUGH THE WINTER. IN 2013, THE

00:24:27.999 --> 00:24:30.535
UNITED NATIONS EDUCATIONAL,

00:24:30.602 --> 00:24:31.036
SCIENTIFIC AND CULTURAL

00:24:31.102 --> 00:24:33.505
ORGANIZATION OFFICIALLY

00:24:33.572 --> 00:24:34.506
RECOGNIZED GIMJANG ON ITS

00:24:34.573 --> 00:24:36.274
REPRESENTATIVE LIST OF THE

00:24:36.341 --> 00:24:37.275
INTANGIBLE CULTURAL HERITAGE OF

00:24:37.342 --> 00:24:39.711
HUMANITY. THIS DESIGNATION LED

00:24:39.778 --> 00:24:41.346
TO THE ESTABLISHMENT OF THE

00:24:41.413 --> 00:24:43.481
KIMCHI DAY HOLIDAY IN KOREA AND

00:24:43.548 --> 00:24:44.549
THE CELEBRATION OF KIMCHI DAY

00:24:44.616 --> 00:24:46.718
HERE IN THE UNITED STATES. NOW,

00:24:46.785 --> 00:24:48.587
FOR ME, GROWING UP AND BEING

00:24:48.653 --> 00:24:51.489
ABLE TO CELEBRATE KIMCHI DAY IS

00:24:51.556 --> 00:24:54.392
REALLY AN EMOTIONAL MOMENT

00:24:54.459 --> 00:24:55.527
BECAUSE GROWING UP AS A KOREAN

00:24:55.594 --> 00:24:57.696
KID IN THIS COUNTRY, IN

00:24:57.762 --> 00:24:58.797
CALIFORNIA, THERE WERE NO OTHER

00:24:58.864 --> 00:25:01.833
KOREANS IN MY CLASS. AND BACK

00:25:01.900 --> 00:25:03.034
THEN, UNLIKE WITH MY KIDS TODAY

00:25:03.101 --> 00:25:04.302
BEING KOREAN WAS DECIDEDLY NOT

00:25:04.369 --> 00:25:09.541
COOL, AND SO FOR ME, GROWING UP,

00:25:09.608 --> 00:25:11.977
KIMCHI WAS KIND OF THE,

00:25:12.043 --> 00:25:13.011
EMBODIMENT OF EVERYTHING THAT I

00:25:13.078 --> 00:25:16.147
KIND OF WAS LED TO FEEL ASHAMED

00:25:16.214 --> 00:25:17.716
OF ABOUT MY OWN CULTURE. IT WAS

00:25:17.782 --> 00:25:18.950
A STINKY FOOD THAT NOBODY KNEW.

00:25:19.017 --> 00:25:21.987
AND LIKE, EVERYONE MADE FUN OF

00:25:22.053 --> 00:25:23.588
IT. NO ONE WANTED TO EAT IT.

00:25:23.655 --> 00:25:25.724
GROSS. YUCK THOSE WERE ALL THE

00:25:25.790 --> 00:25:26.858
TERMS I HEARD WHENEVER PEOPLE

00:25:26.925 --> 00:25:29.961
SAW KIMCHI, SO TO SEE IT

00:25:30.028 --> 00:25:31.096
CELEBRATED TODAY, TO SEE PEOPLE

00:25:31.162 --> 00:25:34.366
ACTUALLY EAT IT IS REALLY AN

00:25:34.432 --> 00:25:35.467
AMAZING THING. AND IT'S VERY

00:25:35.533 --> 00:25:37.402
GOOD FOR YOU. IT'S GOT LOTS OF

00:25:37.469 --> 00:25:38.403
PROBIOTICS AND LIKE YOUR

00:25:38.470 --> 00:25:39.437
